### 1. Create a Campaign Quest (DM/Admin Only)
POST {{dndhelper_HostAddress}}/api/quest
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": "{{CampaignId}}",
  "title": "Help Bob",
  "description": "Help Bob find their lost treasure",
  "location": "Bob's Realm",
  "status": "Available",
  "type": "Side",
  "objectives": [
    {
      "description": "Find Clues",
      "currentProgress": 2,
      "completionThreshold": 10
    }
  ],
  "rewardCurrencies":[{
    "type": "gp",
    "amount": 100,
    "currencyCode": "gp"
  }]
}

###

### 2. Get Quests for a Campaign
GET {{dndhelper_HostAddress}}/api/quest/campaign/{{CampaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Add an Objective to a Quest Atomically
POST {{dndhelper_HostAddress}}/api/quest/{{QuestId}}/objective
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Defeat monsters 2",
  "currentProgress": 0,
  "completionThreshold": 5
}

###

### 4. Update Quest Objective Progress
PUT {{dndhelper_HostAddress}}/api/quest/{{QuestId}}/objective
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "objective-guid-here",
  "description": "Interrogate the tavern keeper",
  "currentProgress": 1,
  "completionThreshold": 1,
  "isCompleted": true
}

###

### 5. Create a Personal Quest (As a Player)
POST {{dndhelper_HostAddress}}/api/quest
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": "650c5f11e0c24b17b8ef1234",
  "involvedCharacterIds": ["650c5f11e0c24b17b8ef5678"],
  "title": "Avenge My Family",
  "description": "Track down the red-branded rogue who stole the heirloom.",
  "type": "Personal",
  "status": "Active",
  "objectives": []
}

###

### 6. Get a Specific Quest by ID
GET {{dndhelper_HostAddress}}/api/quest/650c5f11e0c24b17b8ef9999
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Update an Entire Quest Document
PUT {{dndhelper_HostAddress}}/api/quest/650c5f11e0c24b17b8ef9999
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "campaignId": {{CampaignId}},
  "title": "Uncover the Cult's Lair (Updated)",
  "description": "Find where the dragon cult is gathering in the city sewers.",
  "location": "Waterdeep Sewers - Lower Levels",
  "status": "Active",
  "type": "Main",
  "objectives": []
}

###

### 8. Delete an Objective Atomically
DELETE {{dndhelper_HostAddress}}/api/quest/650c5f11e0c24b17b8ef9999/objective/objective-guid-here
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Delete a Quest
DELETE {{dndhelper_HostAddress}}/api/quest/650c5f11e0c24b17b8ef9999
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Accept: application/json

